WEBVTT

00:25.660 --> 00:26.750
Here’s the lighttime!

00:26.750 --> 00:28.770
Will you guys click the follow button?

00:28.770 --> 00:29.330
Come on!

00:30.410 --> 00:31.750
Lu Guang, say something!

00:33.450 --> 00:35.080
Follow us, please!

01:02.200 --> 01:03.000
Could it be...

01:03.520 --> 01:05.790
No wonder Wang Juan and Cheng Xiaoshi
were possessed at the same time

01:38.330 --> 01:39.390
What does this mean?

01:51.970 --> 01:53.160
I see

01:54.330 --> 01:55.200
Excuse me for a moment

02:01.080 --> 02:01.470
What happened

02:01.470 --> 02:02.200
Miss Qiao

02:02.200 --> 02:03.390
I gotta see Captain Xiao

02:03.870 --> 02:05.620
Take care of the girl

02:14.290 --> 02:15.220
Captin Xiao

02:15.220 --> 02:15.560
I find out...

02:15.560 --> 02:16.000
That matches my findings exactly.
I find out...

02:16.000 --> 02:17.580
That matches my findings exactly.

02:18.700 --> 02:19.370
Qiao Ling

02:19.830 --> 02:20.830
How’s the communication going

02:22.040 --> 02:23.120
Cheng Xiaoshi

02:23.700 --> 02:25.060
Have you found where Lu Guang is

04:23.910 --> 04:24.870
I got there just in time

04:26.080 --> 04:28.160
Almost at the perfect timing

04:43.750 --> 04:45.930
Sorry, Lu Guang

04:47.160 --> 04:48.120
Because of you

04:49.040 --> 04:51.290
I don't wanna proceed down this path.

04:56.870 --> 04:59.000
When I was about to change the past

04:59.830 --> 05:00.810
Don’t let her go

05:02.000 --> 05:03.080
I found that

05:03.750 --> 05:05.950
I neglected another factor
I couldn’t change

05:09.810 --> 05:11.540
My impetuousness

05:12.120 --> 05:13.250
and imprudence

05:13.250 --> 05:15.830
Idiot!

05:20.310 --> 05:23.000
I should avoid a more
unpredictable consequence

05:23.620 --> 05:24.700
so

05:25.290 --> 05:26.870
I had to change the plan then

05:27.540 --> 05:28.620
Catch Li Tianchen

05:29.040 --> 05:30.370
In no case

05:30.700 --> 05:32.390
shall I let Lu Guang go with him

05:39.540 --> 05:40.290
Good job

05:46.040 --> 05:47.120
At that moment

05:48.080 --> 05:49.870
I suddenly felt something strange

05:56.080 --> 05:57.870
But before I realized it

05:57.870 --> 05:59.310
I had exited the photo

05:59.910 --> 06:00.910
and went back here

06:05.120 --> 06:05.890
Cheng Xiaoshi

06:06.700 --> 06:08.000
You come back so soon

06:09.250 --> 06:11.080
Where did Lu Guang go with Li Tianchen later

06:13.580 --> 06:15.410
I was forced to exit the photo

06:16.160 --> 06:17.580
I don’t know why

06:18.910 --> 06:20.370
Forced to exit

06:20.950 --> 06:23.220
Yes. Just like what happened before

06:34.620 --> 06:35.370
Cheng Xiaoshi

06:36.790 --> 06:38.250
I’ve experienced the same thing

06:39.200 --> 06:40.540
Being forced to exit

06:50.450 --> 06:52.370
Seems that each time this
happened, there was...

06:53.120 --> 06:53.870
body contact

06:55.290 --> 06:55.620
Yes

06:56.250 --> 06:59.040
I watched the surveillance video
over and over, and found this too

07:00.540 --> 07:02.220
When Wang Juan took you
out of the police station

07:03.040 --> 07:04.910
Li Tianchen held Wang Juan’s hand

07:04.910 --> 07:05.580
and yours

07:07.200 --> 07:08.200
So we may suppose that

07:08.620 --> 07:11.030
His ability to control others depends on

07:11.030 --> 07:12.040
body contact

07:13.830 --> 07:16.910
I also hate being a freak
in the eyes of others

07:18.330 --> 07:18.890
Sorry

07:19.200 --> 07:20.290
I didn’t mean that

07:20.290 --> 07:21.450
Then

07:23.410 --> 07:24.700
promise me one more thing

07:28.790 --> 07:30.560
Why did you come at such a perfect timing

07:30.560 --> 07:33.330
Just when I asked to go to the restroom

07:33.330 --> 07:34.190
What did you say

07:34.190 --> 07:35.080
I can't hear you

07:36.450 --> 07:38.580
Why did you come at such a perfect timing

07:39.370 --> 07:42.200
Just when I asked to go to the restroom

07:42.750 --> 07:43.660
Ask again

07:44.140 --> 07:45.250
I'm asking

07:48.500 --> 07:50.250
From this perspective,

07:50.250 --> 07:51.060
then

07:51.060 --> 07:53.400
why did Wang Juan take you out

07:53.400 --> 07:55.950
and why was she handcuffed to a pipe

07:56.830 --> 07:57.910
All this are explained

08:04.910 --> 08:05.870
Why am I here

08:09.910 --> 08:10.870
Cheng Xiaoshi

08:12.290 --> 08:14.580
There’s still one thing unexplained

08:15.790 --> 08:18.370
Body contact requires a close distance

08:19.580 --> 08:20.870
How could he control others

08:21.540 --> 08:23.000
from afar

08:24.080 --> 08:24.910
Here is the key

08:26.830 --> 08:28.870
Actually, the siblings both
have special abilities

08:29.410 --> 08:32.350
Li Tianxi can possess others

08:32.350 --> 08:34.500
through photos

08:34.500 --> 08:36.000
and see what they see

08:36.330 --> 08:38.250
According the answers she gave me,

08:38.620 --> 08:39.750
through a photo,

08:39.750 --> 08:42.500
she can know what the person in it is doing

08:42.500 --> 08:43.620
and even the memory

08:44.000 --> 08:45.040
But she cannot ‘be’ the person

08:47.450 --> 08:48.850
That makes sense

08:48.850 --> 08:50.850
He asserted that I was lying back then

08:50.850 --> 08:52.660
You’re lying

08:55.330 --> 08:56.700
You can fool me

08:57.750 --> 08:59.410
But you can't fool her

09:00.000 --> 09:01.830
He said I couldn’t fool her,

09:02.830 --> 09:04.290
the person whose thoughts
were possessed. It’s you,

09:04.870 --> 09:05.580
Qiao Ling

09:07.040 --> 09:08.540
So like Lu Guang and I,

09:08.870 --> 09:10.330
they can cooperate to use their abilities.

09:10.750 --> 09:12.750
In this way, remote control is feasible

09:14.160 --> 09:15.830
No wonder he stated that

09:15.830 --> 09:17.370
his aim was me

09:18.370 --> 09:19.870
Interesting

09:20.540 --> 09:21.660
I really wanna take it from you

09:22.410 --> 09:24.450
and experience it myself

09:24.910 --> 09:26.200
Take it from me

09:26.200 --> 09:27.790
He wanna use my ability

09:27.790 --> 09:29.080
to return to the past,

09:29.080 --> 09:30.040
control someone,

09:30.620 --> 09:31.750
and then change the history

09:32.370 --> 09:34.120
Fortunately, Lu Guang...

09:35.040 --> 09:36.910
But how can we find Lu Guang

09:45.160 --> 09:48.080
This half-dead person's
wound is still bleeding

09:49.370 --> 09:50.950
I don't want him to die here.

09:52.830 --> 09:54.200
We need to figure out a way

09:54.200 --> 09:55.290
to bring Cheng Xiaoshi here

10:01.330 --> 10:02.830
As long as we have his abilities,

10:03.580 --> 10:07.160
we can rewrite everything in the past.

10:08.020 --> 10:10.250
including finding your lost sister

10:15.950 --> 10:16.830
Do it

10:23.120 --> 10:24.140
Xixi

10:24.140 --> 10:25.500
We’re gonna have dinner

10:26.160 --> 10:27.660
Come here and take a nap

10:51.290 --> 10:51.870
Let’s go

11:03.290 --> 11:04.080
Let’s go

11:14.700 --> 11:15.330
Officer Chen

11:16.080 --> 11:16.790
Coming

11:26.910 --> 11:27.880
Go ahead

11:27.880 --> 11:29.080
Watch them tightly

11:29.080 --> 11:30.450
Don’t mess it up

11:30.910 --> 11:31.830
Got it

11:54.790 --> 11:57.040
Hurry. Did you get the stuff

12:14.660 --> 12:15.250
Hello

12:16.580 --> 12:18.370
It’s the first I greet you like this

12:19.040 --> 12:20.250
How magical

12:24.750 --> 12:26.580
The baby’s on the way

12:26.910 --> 12:28.120
What a pity

12:55.950 --> 12:56.770
Xixi

12:57.040 --> 12:57.950
Damn it

13:06.700 --> 13:07.330
Boss

13:07.700 --> 13:08.500
What’s wrong

13:08.870 --> 13:09.810
Shall we chase them

13:13.370 --> 13:14.700
Check how’s Ma doing

13:15.450 --> 13:16.750
in case of any problem

13:18.750 --> 13:20.580
I never thought that

13:21.250 --> 13:23.200
you would lose her that day.

13:28.620 --> 13:29.410
You know that

13:30.500 --> 13:32.200
I detest betrayal the most

13:33.040 --> 13:34.200
Even if it's her,

13:35.830 --> 13:37.580
I won't show any mercy.

13:40.410 --> 13:42.410
Don't we still have other options?

13:44.450 --> 13:45.250
Tell me,

13:45.910 --> 13:49.450
what do you propose for our final move?

13:53.620 --> 13:54.970
Could you please

13:54.970 --> 13:56.700
help us find Lu Guang

13:57.370 --> 13:58.120
I know

13:58.120 --> 14:01.020
you can see Lu Guang’s current
situation through this photo

14:35.160 --> 14:36.220
You are Li Tianchen, right?

14:37.790 --> 14:39.790
No wonder you're a great
partner of Cheng Xiaoshi.

14:40.290 --> 14:41.700
What a good brain you have.

14:43.410 --> 14:43.910
So

14:45.120 --> 14:47.850
how did you know about the
time and location of our plan?

14:47.850 --> 14:49.120
If I tell you,

14:49.750 --> 14:51.720
won’t I lose my value?

14:51.720 --> 14:53.040
Who knows

14:54.410 --> 14:56.830
You’re our final card.

15:01.830 --> 15:03.270
Final card

15:03.270 --> 15:05.470
Sounds like you’re in a predicament

15:07.330 --> 15:09.970
You really annoy me.

15:09.970 --> 15:12.200
I regret being too lenient before.

15:13.200 --> 15:13.950
But now,

15:14.500 --> 15:17.160
I won't let you die so easily.

15:40.410 --> 15:41.200
What’s wrong

15:41.660 --> 15:42.600
What did you see

15:48.370 --> 15:49.770
Is Lu Guang alright

15:49.770 --> 15:50.870
Please at least tell me

15:50.870 --> 15:52.120
where is he?

15:52.120 --> 15:53.200
Cheng Xiaoshi

15:58.790 --> 16:01.330
Easy. Easy. Easy.

16:03.830 --> 16:06.290
Lu Guang...Is he fine?

16:11.330 --> 16:13.290
The bleeding is stanched for now

16:14.040 --> 16:15.080
You should be able to hang in

16:17.950 --> 16:20.330
What do you want

16:20.950 --> 16:21.700
Relax

16:22.700 --> 16:23.370
Get your clothes changed

16:24.450 --> 16:27.160
It’ll be your show time in a minute

16:39.660 --> 16:40.370
Cheng Xiaoshi

16:43.250 --> 16:46.330
Li Tianchen called me with
a virtue number just now,

16:47.160 --> 16:49.430
asking us to exchange you for Lu Guang

16:50.700 --> 16:52.450
Generally speaking, in such case,

16:53.390 --> 16:55.580
they’ll try to deploy police force

16:55.580 --> 16:56.700
Besides the periphery,

16:57.370 --> 17:00.790
accompanying personnel and even hostages to
be exchanged may be replaced with police officers

17:02.660 --> 17:05.080
The best way to disturb their deployment

17:05.080 --> 17:07.100
is to reduce the reaction time.

17:07.790 --> 17:09.750
He asked to exchange hostages at 3 a.m.

17:10.120 --> 17:12.450
Lu Guang may be in danger
after the time limit

17:13.290 --> 17:14.700
Only 35 minutes left for us

17:15.120 --> 17:17.020
It’ll take at least 20 minutes to get there

17:18.000 --> 17:19.250
As for my colleagues,

17:19.250 --> 17:21.410
some are investigating the
attackers against Wang Juan

17:22.000 --> 17:24.250
some are arranged by me to
search and track Qian Jin

17:26.500 --> 17:29.200
So it is very likely that Xiao
Li has to take action first

17:29.830 --> 17:31.870
and ask for reinforcements later

17:32.950 --> 17:34.540
Even if he has any trick

17:35.200 --> 17:37.580
I’ve arranged a stalker
outside the police station

17:42.270 --> 17:45.330
If Xiao Li proposes that he
will escort Cheng Xiaoshi here

17:45.790 --> 17:48.160
ask him to change the escort

17:48.160 --> 17:50.040
He says the only person
who can go there with you

17:50.660 --> 17:51.580
is

17:53.500 --> 17:57.000
I still remember the slap in my face.

17:58.160 --> 17:58.870
Qiao Ling

17:59.200 --> 18:01.020
OK. I agree.

18:03.930 --> 18:04.580
Wait a minute

18:05.330 --> 18:07.290
There should be another solution

18:07.870 --> 18:09.430
No time for pondering

18:09.430 --> 18:11.080
Shall we discuss on the way

18:27.830 --> 18:28.930
After you enter the place

18:29.700 --> 18:30.580
remember to keep the door open

18:31.000 --> 18:32.080
for the reinforcements

19:01.160 --> 19:03.250
Welcome here, our guests

19:03.250 --> 19:04.620
The show is about to start

19:05.500 --> 19:07.620
Please enter from the entrance to the theater

19:21.540 --> 19:24.540
No belongings are allowed to be taken in

19:25.160 --> 19:28.330
Due to Mr. Cheng’s poor credit

19:30.040 --> 19:32.120
I have prepared costumes
for you two specially

19:32.700 --> 19:36.080
Please enter the theater
after changing your clothes

19:38.080 --> 19:39.660
Seems that Qian Jin has foreseen our action

19:42.950 --> 19:43.580
How’s there

19:43.580 --> 19:44.560
Everyone in place?

19:45.450 --> 19:46.250
Yes, sir

19:46.890 --> 19:48.580
Ready for your assault instruction

19:57.080 --> 19:58.830
Please put down the items in your hands

19:59.250 --> 20:01.160
and accept the security check again

20:07.370 --> 20:08.950
Both monitoring and monitoring
equipment have been removed

20:09.580 --> 20:11.500
Now it’s up to you to feel
their current condition

20:37.330 --> 20:38.000
Lu Guang

20:39.790 --> 20:41.250
Stop, stop

20:41.250 --> 20:42.830
Patience, please

20:43.160 --> 20:46.660
To prevent accidents such as personal injury

20:47.370 --> 20:50.080
be sure to strictly follow
the rules of this show,

20:50.790 --> 20:51.330
shall we?

20:52.500 --> 20:55.580
Please walk slowly towards each other

21:01.250 --> 21:02.620
One more time

21:03.870 --> 21:07.870
Please walk slowly towards each other

21:16.620 --> 21:18.500
Then move to the original position

21:18.950 --> 21:20.500
of each other respectively

21:30.080 --> 21:30.580
No worries

21:31.700 --> 21:32.580
I’ve got a plan

21:44.910 --> 21:46.870
Well done. Bravo

21:48.040 --> 21:48.700
Lu Guang

21:56.450 --> 21:57.200
Now

21:58.250 --> 22:00.160
you may wave to the viewers
for a curtain call

22:02.950 --> 22:03.770
Cheng Xiaoshi

22:10.080 --> 22:10.910
Cheng Xiaoshi

22:19.410 --> 22:19.870
Captian Xiao

22:21.660 --> 22:22.850
I’ve got Lu Guang back

22:22.850 --> 22:24.040
How’s Cheng Xiaoshi

22:32.580 --> 22:34.250
At last, we meet each other in person

22:38.580 --> 22:39.810
Without photos

22:39.810 --> 22:41.660
you have no chance to cheat now

22:58.950 --> 22:59.750
Assault begins

23:00.120 --> 23:01.720
Catch Li Tianchen and Qian Jin

23:04.250 --> 23:05.040
Nice job

23:05.370 --> 23:06.680
Surprisingly, your plan works

23:06.680 --> 23:08.180
Are Lu Guang and Qiao Ling safe

23:08.870 --> 23:10.290
We just talked on the phone

23:10.290 --> 23:11.450
They’ll come out soon

23:16.830 --> 23:17.500
Hey,

23:17.830 --> 23:19.290
can you see them now

23:24.750 --> 23:25.410
Shit

23:25.950 --> 23:27.700
Stay in the car, Cheng Xiaoshi

23:32.830 --> 23:33.330
Captain Xiao

23:34.790 --> 23:39.160
Hi, good to see you again

23:39.660 --> 23:41.600
No more tricks now

23:42.080 --> 23:43.910
Come with me
